{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_horn_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_horn_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"独奏曲","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_horn_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"8f1354651c089991bbcc8f9a03c8539bcba32a54fdc0d329ae7b5cba4cf849c3","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"narration","text":"（备忘录的第一页）\n三角铁，小鼓，贝斯，曼陀林，大提琴，双簧管。\n我不会忘记。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......蔓德拉长官真的那么说了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，命令如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她竟然也去找什么贵族！我跟着她难道不就是因为我不想被那些贵族老爷颐指气使吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还警告我们不要对萨卡兹出言不逊？和那些魔族合作？开什么玩笑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官要是在场，你已经被穿在石柱上了，说话长点心吧。她有自己的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......或者领袖有自己的想法，那样你就更不应该多嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过来，维多利亚佬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官叫我们把你的镣铐解开，你可以出去散散心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这又是什么把戏？你们想在背后用弩指着我，通过看我逃跑来取乐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你们可以试试，结局会让你们失望的——或者你们都没命去失望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你听，这家伙嘴还是这么硬，和所有的维多利亚佬一样傲慢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你说的不算全错，如果你以为自己能逃跑，那你确实该看看自己能不能跑过箭矢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，维多利亚人。这是蔓德拉长官的意思，她允许你在进入伦蒂尼姆之前偶尔有一点自由活动的时间，你最好知道领情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看见你们那座都城的城墙了吗？它从这里看还是那么高大、威严、坚不可摧，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多看看，然后记住这种壮丽的幻象吧，等你进了城，你会怀念这些错觉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们知道伦蒂尼姆里面发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你过几天就会亲眼见到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，伦蒂尼姆的现状如何，跟你这个迟早要死的家伙也没多少关系了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各、各位，请问这里离最近的聚落还有多远？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聚落？哈，你是逃出来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别傻了，逃出来的人这么多，附近的聚落哪里容得下你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我们是来自远方的军队，女士。这里我们也并不熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等一下，你是从伦蒂尼姆里面逃出来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伦蒂尼姆......现在变成什么样子了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你还不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹动手了，伦蒂尼姆已经是他们拿在手里的玩具了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——没人知道城防军去了哪里，听说是从内部被瓦解了。没有人出来保护维多利亚的普通市民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她怎么知道我要问什么？深池的士兵又为什么对这个维多利亚人一反常态地客气？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但其实我也不知道庞大的伦蒂尼姆里究竟发生了多少事，我已经出城有一段时间了，只是在四处徘徊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那么伦蒂尼姆外围呢？这里聚集着多少贵族的势力，你是否心里有数？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是一介小市民该知道的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我甚至也不知道大名鼎鼎的“白狼”伯爵是否在附近。他曾经对我父母有救命之恩，多年来我一直崇敬着他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......遗憾，我知道您所说的那个人，但我已经很多年没听到过他的名号了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（您认识我。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（点头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜测他已经和某些贵族合作，在这场纷争里站好队了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我猜“白狼”不打算跟别的贵族合作。他更在乎自己的家园，而不是王座的归属。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，打听消息到此为止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是尚有军纪的军队，恐怕和你在伦蒂尼姆见过的那些散兵游勇不一样，女士。趁天黑之前，尽快离开这里赶路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对不起，我这就离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你们会进入伦蒂尼姆，对吗？握个手吧，士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这是我个人的希望。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——希望你回到伦蒂尼姆之后有机会向我的家人问好。我出逃的时候他们决定留下来，不知道我们还能不能再见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出逃的伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们家住在码头，你见到我女儿的时候一定会认出她的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，我会尽力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果我没有猜错，她应当......是那位莫宁伯爵的信使。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"士兵，你应该知道我是为什么来“看望”你的，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真可怜，你似乎还指望着自己的贵族身份能让你拥有几分话语权，通过个人表态来左右其他人的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看过自己现在这个样子吗？不知道自己弃子的命运，打了一场彻头彻尾的败仗，害死了自己所有的手下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早就被拔光了獠牙，却还在叫嚣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你这么恼火，以至于时隔多日又来对我冷嘲热讽，那就说明你求助的那位贵族拆穿了你的谎言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。我从不会让领袖失望，所以，你得失望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的小聪明和话术什么也改变不了！他们并不关心你是否真的与深池合作，只要你还活着，他们就会把赌注押在深池这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从你的白日梦里醒醒吧，绝大多数人可不像你一样，只想为维多利亚而死。他们只会千方百计地试图保住自己的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别担心，小菲林。至少在为维多利亚而死之前，我一定会先让你去死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你就这么喜欢硬撑着，假装自己还没有被打倒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就尽管不相信我说的话吧，反正你会慢慢看到事实的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G1_interrogat_room"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，那个维多利亚的疯子，咱们还得看着啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"定时去看一眼就是了，长官说了，要确保她活着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......十九，二十，二十一......再来，三角铁，重新开始训练计数......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你听，她又开始自言自语了。前段时间还有清醒的时候，现在我们对她说什么她都听不进去了，每天只跟死人的影子聊天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，你去休息吧，该换我值班了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......现在我们假设敌人的编队中有盾卫和术师，而这里是投弹手的位置......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，长官可是好吃好喝地招待你，没让你受一点审讯折磨之类的，这就精神不正常了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难过成这样，就因为你死了几个朋友？你想不想知道我们塔拉人失去了多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真不知道你这样的废物是怎么在维多利亚的军队里当上......中尉？哈，你的头衔是这个吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......别乱来，站在我的盾后面。就算你身体素质再好，也不能硬扛爆炸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是一点反应都没有，算了。继续和你幻想中的朋友聊天吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你自己肯定都不记得了。以前你还说过，自己出任务从来没失败过，你的盾总能保护每一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，被我们打成这样对你来说太耻辱了，所以你就强行把这段经历忘掉了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，长官把你留在这里，也挺好玩——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——这疯子又在干什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......人呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天花板上的通风口被拆掉了？......你真以为自己跑得掉？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想从通风口走？给我出来，维多利亚佬！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是真的以为我疯了，才敢一个人打开房门试图抓住我。多谢你的掉以轻心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎么......你哪里来的刀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有个热心人希望我回到伦蒂尼姆之后向她的家人问好，顺手给了我一把小型折叠刀。虽然不算武器，但用来拆掉通风口足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顺带一提，这里的通风管道可不足以让一个人爬出去，否则我早就走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......通讯终端借我一用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你是真的疯了。你想就这么从我们基地的最深处大摇大摆地走出去？只拿着一把小刀？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别跑！你要从这里的窗户跳下去，是吗？我不会让你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g10_lightinduarea_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摄政王......终于同意见我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，他们确实看到了深池的武力......即使我们双方都心知肚明，深池和萨卡兹王庭无法真正同盟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。领袖当然早就计划好——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——什么声音？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人袭击？但萨卡兹不可能......他们的王明明答应把深池当作客人来招待！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道是那些自不量力的维多利亚军人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，他们总共没剩多少活人，怎么会来主动招惹我们？而且伦蒂尼姆的上等人恐怕根本没见识过深池的火......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g8_jail"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......漂亮的施术，祝你在自己引发的爆炸里睡得安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是听够你说的话了。从你第一次拿他们开玩笑的时候开始，我就打算让你永远闭嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不过你说得对，我可能也不算完全没疯。我也不知道一遍又一遍自揭伤疤，究竟是让我变得更清醒......还是陷得更深。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通讯声","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么回事？整幢楼都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通讯声","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是建筑内部发生的爆炸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通讯声","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们快带队去救人，我去报告长官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（周围的巡逻队被引向了爆炸发生地，符合计划。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，本次任务......只有一人参与行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行动方案，从这里逃出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......备用行动方案，跟深池拼命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何都不会失败的任务，真让人感到轻松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——第二风暴突击队队长号角，出发。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g10_lightinduarea_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报告，蔓德拉长官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"旧烟草厂发生了爆炸！似乎是通风管道积尘引发的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这有什么可慌张的，这种小事件你们都不会处理吗？我以为你们看过不少爆炸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......长官。您应该还记得，那个维多利亚士兵也被关在旧烟草厂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，去爆炸现场进行救援的士兵发现，她似乎......跑掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"废物......你们这些废物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还说她疯了？我就知道她是装的......她哪有那么容易被打倒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道......萨卡兹不会与我们为敌，伦蒂尼姆的军队暂时也想不到我们......只有她，只有这个家伙会袭击我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，不过她能跑到哪里去？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g8_jail"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通讯声","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......第三小队封锁仓库附近......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通讯声","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼叫沃尔特......今天轮班的守卫不是他吗？第七小队，派两个人在爆炸现场搜寻一下沃尔特......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通讯声","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么短的时间，她一定还在这个街区内......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......猜得很对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的封锁搜查，我无处可逃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，这里没有其他人。脚步声从墙那边过去了，那几个深池士兵没看见我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但是有人一直在盯着这里。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通讯声","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她留下了痕迹，应该是往食品加工厂的方向去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通讯声","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要让她躲进工厂！关上所有的门！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不太巧啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通讯声","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沃尔特已经死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通讯声","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有通讯终端，也被拿走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池通讯声","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关闭守备队的通讯接入权限！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......通讯终端没声音了。他们反应过来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那里！有人爬上去了！探照灯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们去楼顶追！你们从旁边架弩！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工厂的门，开着？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报告，这边没有异常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大门——大门怎么——我刚才明明关上——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来不是深池玩忽职守，打开这扇门的另有其人。"},{"type":"narration","text":"士兵闪身躲到墙后，警惕地环顾四周。工厂阴湿的空气像是被扼住了喉咙一样静默，让人感觉不出一丝流动。\n就像风被谁切断了一样。\n这不是她第一次感觉到异样的视线。在那间幽闭的斗室里，她警觉的神经也曾被挑动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盯着我的人，你是谁？"},{"type":"narration","text":"没有任何声音回答她。只有方才路过工厂大门时一闪而过的源石技艺的气息，让她确信这里另有一人在场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（——不，他在盯着整个深池看。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是萨卡兹人吗？是那高居王座之上的意志在审视伦蒂尼姆的乱象吗？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大门开着！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到了！她在那里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（一队士兵，正从楼上向下移动，安全通道的门会被立刻撞开。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（有至少三名弩手正在瞄准这扇窗外面的平台。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但这里有无数的管道和集装箱。我可以耐心地躲藏一段时间，比这些深池的士兵更加耐心。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（而且深池在让这家工厂正常运转，用以补充士兵的日常物资。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（既然这样，这家工厂就应该还有一个会定时启用的出口......通往地下层的物流运输口。我可以找机会打开它。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在构思出逃方案的同时，她听见大门缓缓打开的声音从地下传来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......感谢你，不肯露面的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个士兵，就藏在这里面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在哪里？你又要逃去哪里？士兵，你的军队已经不复存在了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至走不出这个萨迪恩区哪怕一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你在那些已经被控制的城区冒头，你就会被魔族流淌源石技艺的刀刃刺穿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出来吧，我可是为了你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你出去，你就会看到，大多数不听话的维多利亚士兵，下场远比你那支小队的几位朋友更凄惨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"顺着阴影向运输口匍匐移动的号角蓦地停下了脚步，深池的术师背朝着她，就站在走廊外的灯光底下。\n号角的手里攥着一柄从深池士兵身上夺来的细剑。如果菲林来得及驱动自己的源石技艺，脆弱的剑刃于刺过去的瞬间便会在岩石上折断。\n但是如果对方没来得及反应——\n号角握紧剑的同时，蔓德拉朝她的方向转过头来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中尉，您也醒着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。刚刚醒来，正好快到我换班站岗的时间了。怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......只是我也恰好没睡，看到您这边点起了蜡烛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——抱歉，我打扰您记备忘录了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，没有什么重要的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中尉，我有提起过吗？我以前就生活在萨迪恩区，住在纺织厂背后的小巷里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家里习惯在临街的窗台上留一支蜡烛燃着，因为巷子里没有灯，他们想给半夜下工的人们照一下路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢您的烛火，有一瞬间，它让我感觉......一切都没那么灰暗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果是以前，我会说念旧不是件好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在，恐怕只有执着于维多利亚该有的样子、伦蒂尼姆的市民该有的生活，我们才能在城市的暗处斗争下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，虽说是有点不切实际的念想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会的。我们相信您，中尉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚的军人没有那么容易被打倒......维多利亚的子民都是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不过，我们也都很担心您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有什么可担心的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您虽然不愿意对我们多说，但我们都是士兵，在许多事情上受的触动想必是相似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今夜我代您站岗，您再休息一会儿吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
